  "description": "Syncfusion® Blazor A2UI Library is a thin Blazor renderer for the A2UI v0.9 protocol (originally @a2ui/web_core by Google LLC). Built on top of Syncfusion.A2UI.Core, it provides Blazor nodes, a node-surface, binder adapters and an optional rich set of Syncfusion Syncfusion.Blazor.*-backed component implementations for DataGrid, Chart, Scheduler, RichTextEditor, Kanban, Diagram, Document Editor, Spreadsheet, PDF Viewer and more. Compatible with .NET 8, .NET 9, and .NET 10. Targets Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.",
